#   /concepts/ + /common_modules/ pages, IRREPRODUCIBILITY_LEDGER.html, C4 access layer (robots/sitemap/llms*),
#   answer-first paragraphs + inherits-strip + vp-cards. Edited HTML therefore hashes anew (expected). Scheme
#   unchanged (single-sha256 per file; Bitcoin-style double-sha256 = sha256(sha256(content).digest()) for chain).
